# Luban DataTables

- Prefer extending existing XML modules under `Defines/` instead of dumping all types into one file.
- Keep `#ref=` table full names in sync when renaming tables.
- `t` group is test-oriented (not default export).
- Use `--strict --errorFormat json` for validation-focused runs.
- Study existing samples (polymorphism, variants, tags, multi-format inputs) before inventing new layouts.
- Schema is a contract: fix data or explicitly evolve schema with review.
